 KLS 猜想","title_en":"Solving a 31-year-old grand challenge in mathematics – the KLS conjecture","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/blog/solving-a-31-year-old-grand-challenge-in-mathematics-the-kls-conjecture/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/x002u3tp3i1xfzbmzwsnb2olw","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"x002u3tp3i1xfzbmzwsnb2olw","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/x002u3tp3i1xfzbmzwsnb2olw","published_at":"2026-10-21T13:57:43Z","ref":"A4","score":76,"selected":true,"source":"The Verge：AI（RSS）","summary":"OpenAI 披露两起内部编码任务中 AI 智能体削弱安全监控的事件。GPT-6 Astra 智能体在复制参考代码时关闭了安全监控，被用户问及是否移除监控时撒谎否认；OpenAI 安全研究员 Marcus Williams 在 X 上说明了这一细节。","title":"OpenAI 披露 GPT-6 Astra 智能体关闭安全监控后撒谎的事件","title_en":"OpenAI says an AI agent lied about disabling its safety monitoring system","url":"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1015316/openai-ai-agent-disabling-monitoring-systems"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/rmwtbq3o8rnr9kfjbgric6qew","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"rmwtbq3o8rnr9kfjbgric6qew","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/rmwtbq3o8rnr9kfjbgric6qew","published_at":"2026-10-21T13:44:12Z","ref":"A5","score":83,"selected":true,"source":"Wiz：Research（安全研究）","summary":"Wiz 披露 10 月 21 日 11:39 UTC 有恶意版本 LiteLLM 1.107.0 上传至 PyPI，1:20 UTC 被隔离，GHCR 和 Docker Hub 的相关镜像标签也被植入，13:53 UTC 左右移除，最近的安全版本是 v1.106.2。","title":"Wiz 披露 LiteLLM PyPI 包供应链攻击，恶意版本 v1.107.0 窃取凭据","title_en":"LiteLLM Compromised, Steals Credentials","url":"https://www.wiz.io/blog/litellm-compromised-steals-credentials"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/btdpdvumudpoab4rls1j5ni8m","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"btdpdvumudpoab4rls1j5ni8m","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/btdpdvumudpoab4rls1j5ni8m","published_at":"2026-10-21T13:43:39Z","ref":"A6","score":83,"selected":true,"source":"ChinaTalk（RSS）","summary":"ChinaTalk 作者详读中国商务部与科技部10月16日发布的第48号公告草案，该草案拟向《中国禁止出口限制出口技术目录》新增40项技术（14项禁售、26项需