opic 的 IPO 草案文件，显示其上半年收入 $16.3B、纸面亏损 $80.7B，并承诺约 $4500 亿算力支出。","title":"WSJ 披露 Anthropic IPO 草案：上半年收入 163 亿美元、纸面亏损 807 亿美元、约 4500 亿美元算力承诺","title_en":"WSJ saw Anthropic’s draft IPO papers: $16.3B revenue in 6 months, $80.7B loss on paper, and about $450B promised for compute","url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2112763999586771238"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/gf3h1rt1vsjw3dnw4hxlie3fv","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"gf3h1rt1vsjw3dnw4hxlie3fv","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/gf3h1rt1vsjw3dnw4hxlie3fv","published_at":"2026-10-21T01:10:02Z","ref":"A13","score":65,"selected":true,"source":"X：Tibo (@thsottiaux)","summary":"OpenAI 开发者账号宣布 API 现已可选 12 小时 prompt 缓存，持续运行的智能体可在请求间隔数小时的情况下继续以更低的缓存输入费率复用指令、工具和上下文。Tibo 补充称，Codex 与 Work 中已登录用户的缓存会永久保留，返回旧对话或数小时后恢复会话保证命中缓存，且无额外惩罚。","title":"OpenAI API 支持 12 小时 prompt 缓存，Codex 与 Work 用户缓存永久保留","title_en":"Day 16/","url":"https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2112712984644784534"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/ndcmko0udqo2kgybo0kolxswj","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"ndcmko0udqo2kgybo0kolxswj","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/ndcmko0udqo2kgybo0kolxswj","published_at":"2026-10-21T00:00:00Z","ref":"A14","score":63,"selected":true,"source":"Google Research：Blog（网页）","summary":"Google Research 在 JAMA Network Open 发表前瞻性多中心研究，评估基于\"盲扫\"超声的 AI 孕周评估模型在不同临床环境和设备上的泛化能力。","title":"Google Research 发表 AI 盲扫超声孕周评估研究，准确性与专家操作相当","title_en":"Empowering frontline maternal care with AI-assisted ultrasound","url":"https://research.google/blog/empowering-frontline-maternal-care-with-ai-assisted-ultrasound/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/jgg0i29t3o1eycc24c3wev0fx","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"jgg0i29t3o1eycc24c3wev0fx","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/jgg0i29t3o1eycc24c3wev0fx","published_at":"2026-10-21T00:00:00Z","ref":"A15","score":73,"selected":true,"source":"Claude：Blog（网页）","summary":"Anthropic 开启 Claude Duet